I trying to get monsters to follow me to an altar, and they
wouldn't chase me.  First I thought they might be tame, but
they weren't.  It reminded me on the "put a dart under a 
boulder to stop orcs from swarming you" effect.  But in this
case, I could see anything in the room that they were trying
to pick up.

I thought that there might be a scroll in a "closet" near the
wall they were swarming.  I tried it out in wizard mode, and 
it seemes to work.  A diagram may help to explain: 


      ?
--------
-..okkG|
|.....o.
.......|
|.......
.@..>..|
